@startuml
' SSD – UC-02: Login / Logout
title SSD – UC-02: Login / Logout

actor "User" as User
participant "SmartTech System" as System

== Login ==

User -> System: 1: enterCredentials(email, password)
activate System

System -> System: 2: validateCredentials(email, password)

alt invalid credentials
    System --> User: 3: return error('Invalid email or password')
else valid credentials
    System -> System: 4: generateAccessToken(userId, role)
    System -> System: 5: generateRefreshToken() → store in HttpOnly cookie
    System --> User: 6: return accessToken + redirectToDashboard()
end

== Logout ==

User -> System: 7: logout()
System -> System: 8: invalidateRefreshToken()
System -> System: 9: clearHttpOnlyCookie()
System --> User: 10: return redirectToHomepage()

deactivate System

@enduml